/* Text the radio keeps on the SD card (HELP.BIN, beside the settings
 * help) instead of in flash, one TEXT(id, "...") each: console command help
 * and usage lines, the menu's category descriptions, export file headers.
 * Plain printable ASCII, no escapes. Edit here, then run
 * tools/gen_help_text.py; validate_current.py checks the two agree.
 *
 * Only text the radio can do without: nothing the boot, a fault or the
 * NO SD CARD hold shows, nothing drawn every frame, nothing the console needs
 * to recover a card (sd, storage, card, fw, id ... keep theirs in flash).
 * With no card the console prints a command's name alone, a usage error
 * says "ERR usage", a category shows no description, and an export is not
 * written anyway. */

TEXT(TXT_CMD_EVENTS, "the last pipeline events, newest first, decoded")
TEXT(TXT_CMD_TELEM, "supply, bias, envelope and detector telemetry")
